      "message": "Done. But this result in a new make try_build_boards error telling us that this should also be added as a Zephyr Kconfig. Do you know if that is enforced? I poked around the Zephyr repo and saw some CONFIG_USB_PD_* defines in src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/include/config_chip.h, but not in any of the Kconfig files other than Kconfig.tcpm which lists a couple as a TODO.",
