      "side": 1,
      "message": "All the zephyr Kconfigs have to be of a form \"PLATFORM_EC_blah_blah\", so we use config_chip.h to translate those into the plain \"CONFIG_blah_blah\" our code usually expects.\n\nI\u0027m guessing the long-run desire for zephyr would be to put this in the device tree.  In which case, that like more of a TODO bug than a fixing in this CL bug.  Adding Keith for his opinion",
